            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Today's? (hodiernus, hodierna, hodiernum.) Yesterday's? (hesternus, hesterna, hesternum.) Tomorrow's? (crāstinus, crāstina, crāstinum.) True? (vērus, vēra, vērum.) Uncertain? (incertus, incerta, incertum.) Bald? (calvus, calva, calvum.) Bearded? (barbātus, barbāta, barbātum.) Charming? (venustus, venusta, venustum.) Worn out? (dēfessus, dēfessa, dēfessum.) Wakeful? (vigil, vigilis.) A roof tile? (tēgula, tēgulae.) A furnace? (fornāx, fornācis.) A litter? (lectīca, lectīcae.) A vehicle? (vehiculum, vehiculī.) A chariot? (currus, currūs.) A pace? (passus, passūs.) A witness? (testis, testis.) A defendant? (reus, reī.) A punishment? (poena, poenae.) A charge? (crīmen, crīminis.)"
